:: Residence_Starr_Courtyard[outdoors]
    <img class='scene' src='img/residence_starr_courtyard.jpg'>\

    <<speech plr>>It sure is imposing, if not in complete disrepair.<</speech>>
    <<button[[Enter the Starr Residence | Residence_Starr_EntryHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[University Main Road | University_MainRoad]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_BanquetHall[room]
    <img class='scene' src='img/residence_starr_banquethall.jpg'>\

    <<speech plr>>The banquet hall is impressive, or at least it would be, if someone had used a broom on it in the last century. Or two.<</speech>>
    <<button [[Entry Hall | Residence_Starr_EntryHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_Bathroom[room]
    <img class='scene' src='img/residence_starr_bathroom.gif'>\

    <<speech plr>>The bathroom is bright and suprisingly modern. But it looks completely unused.<</speech>>
    <<button [[Bedroom Hallway | Residence_Starr_BedroomHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_EntryHall[room]
    <img class='scene' src='img/residence_starr_entryhall.jpg'>\

    You are in the entryway of the residence.

    <<button [[Kitchen | Residence_Starr_Kitchen]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Banquet Room | Residence_Starr_BanquetHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Bedroom Hallway | Residence_Starr_BedroomHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Exit Residence | Residence_Starr_Courtyard]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_BedroomHall[room]
    <img class='scene' src='img/residence_starr_hallway.jpg'>\

    You are in the bedroom hallway.

    <<button [[Your Room | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Bathroom | Residence_Starr_Bathroom]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Entry Hall | Residence_Starr_EntryHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Janessa's Room | Residence_Starr_JanessaRoom]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_JanessaRoom[room]
    <img class='scene' src='img/residence_starr_janessaroom.jpg'>\

    <<speech plr>>$npcs.janessa.name.firstName said to stay out. For now, I should do just that.<</speech>>
    <<button [[Bedroom Hallway | Residence_Starr_BedroomHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_Kitchen[room]
    <img class='scene' src='img/residence_starr_kitchen.jpg'>\

    <<speech plr>>She was right, this place hasn't been used in years.<</speech>>
    <<button [[Entry Hall | Residence_Starr_EntryHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom[room playerHome]
    <img class="scene" src='img/plrroom.jpg'>\

    <<speech plr>>
        I'm in my room. Glancing at the state of the place, it's <<commentClean>> clean. The floor is of <<commentFloor>> quality. I see my <<commentChair>> chair and <<commentDesk>> desk in the corner. On the far wall is my <<commentBed>> bed. The room is <<commentLight>> lit.
    <</speech>>
    <<button [[Look for anything interesting in the clutter | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Searching]]>><</button>>
    <<button [[Try to clean up a bit | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Cleaning]]>>
        <<if $plrRoom.cleanliness <= 2>>
            <<set $plrRoom.cleanliness += 1>>
            <<calcTime 60 30>>
        <</if>>    
    <</button>>
    <<nobr>>
        <<if not hasVisited("Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Sleeping")>>
            <<button [[Try to sleep | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Sleeping]]>>
                <<calcTime 30 5>>
            <</button>>
            <<else>>
            <<button "Try to sleep">>
                <<run
                    Dialog.setup("Pointless Endeavor");
                    Dialog.append("You already know you can't sleep, trying again would just be a waste of time.");
                    Dialog.open();
                >>
            <</button>>
        <</if>>
    <</nobr>>
    <<button 'Rest'>>
        <<set $plr.stats.stamina.cur += 2>>
        <<run Stamina($plr.stats.stamina.cur, $plr.stats.stamina.max, "staminaBar", true)>>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Exit Room | Residence_Starr_BedroomHall]]>>
        <<calcTime 0 5>>
    <</button>>


:: Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Cleaning[minorEvent]
    <img class="scene" src='img/plrroom.jpg'>\
    <<nobr>>
        <<if $plrRoom.cleanliness < 1>>
            <<speech plr>>It's slow progress, but it's definitely looking cleaner. Still disgusting though...<</speech>>
        <<elseif $plrRoom.cleanliness < 3>>
            <<speech plr>>It's certainly cleaner, spending a little more time should get it looking pretty good.<</speech>>
        <<else>>
            <<speech plr>>It's as good as it can get for now.<</speech>>
        <</if>>
    <</nobr>>
        <<speech plr>>It takes so much time cleaning by hand, I wonder if I could use a spell to make this easier on myself?<</speech>>\

    <<button [[Continue | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom]]>><</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Searching[minorEvent]
    <img class="scene" src='img/searchclutter.jpg'>
    <<nobr>>
        <<if $plrRoom.booksFound == 0>>
                <<searchForItem $plrRoom booksFound 3 "miscbook" "mapSchool">>
                <<speech plr>>There is more clutter to look through.<</speech>>
                <<set $unlockVar.userInterface.inventory = true>>

            <<elseif $plrRoom.booksFound == 1>>
                <<searchForItem $plrRoom booksFound 3 "miscbook" "mapTown">>
                <<speech plr>>There is a little more clutter to look through.<</speech>>

            <<elseif $plrRoom.booksFound == 2>>
                <<searchForItem $plrRoom booksFound 3 "spellbook" "spellsBasic">>
                <<speech plr>>There's nothing more to find here.<</speech>>

            <<else>>
                <<speech plr>>This place is picked clean.<</speech>>
        <</if>>
    <</nobr>>
    <<button [[Look back at your room | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom]]>>
    
    <</button>>

:: Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Sleeping
    <img class="scene" src='img/nastybed.jpg'>\
    <<speech plr>>You lay down on your <<commentBed>> bed. After trying for what felt like half an hour, you realize sleep is far from a possibility.<</speech>>\

    <<button [[Stand up | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom]]>>
    <</button>>

